EXTENSION "ARM5e_HM_Abilities" {
    NAME "Hedge Magic Revised - Abilities"
    VERSION "0.3"
    RELEASE_DATE "2026-03-05"
    DEPENDS_ON "ARM5e_Core_Base"
    # Source: Hedge Magic Revised

    #ARM5AB001aB2cD4eF6gH8iJ ^"The folk witch gains a new Supernatural Ability, with an Ability score of 1." DEF {
        APPLIES TO [^"Entity"]
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Ability Type" ENUM ["Arcane"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION """BAD EXPERIENCES

Lost Knowledge: She loses 2 experience points in a Supernatural Ability or in Folk Witch Magic Theory for every Warping Point gained during the Witch Moon. This cannot reduce the score below 0.

New Mystical Flaw: The folk witch gains a Minor Flaw.

Covens

A coven is a group of folk witches (usually three or four, perhaps up to a dozen) who form a community of hedge wizards. Each coven can be thought of as a mini-tradition of its own, and most folk witches seldom meet with witches from other covens.

A coven is also the equivalent of a Hermetic covenant, although the folk witches typically do not live together. Instead, the coven is spread like a web over a geographic locale, with each witch living at least a day's travel from her sisters; each folk witch might live in a separate village, for example. The dispersed nature of the coven means both that the witches quickly notice most activity (supernatural or otherwise) in their locale, and also that they attract little..."""
    }

}
